# LF in the working tree on every platform: committed generated files (THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, the
# mock dataset manifest), shell scripts and .vscodeignore are compared or executed byte for byte,
# and a Windows checkout with autocrlf would turn them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
